 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Gendai Dungeon Life no Tsuzuki wa Isekai Open World de!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "現代ダンジョンライフの続きは異世界オープンワールドで！"
   },
   {
    "en": "My Modern Dungeon Life Continues as an Open World in Another World"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In the modern dungeon, treasure hunters from around the world come together, hoping to find fame and fortune. Naruhito Toyama was one of them—until he lost his life deep inside the dungeon. But instead of disappearing, he wakes up in another world, where strange “arrows” point him toward different paths. Unfortunately, every path leads to disaster. Not willing to accept this fate, Naruhito is determined to break the curse of these evil arrows and find the true ending!",
   "ja": "世界に突如現れた\"ダンジョン\"には一攫千金を狙う\"探索者\"が集い、上級探索者・遠山鳴人もその一人として活躍し、名を馳せていた。\nダンジョンで命を落とすその日までは……。\n\nそして、死んだはずの鳴人が目覚めるとそこは異世界で視界には奇妙な“矢印”が浮かんでいた。\nだが、矢印が導く先は全て破滅へ繋がるBADエンドのようで!?\n\n「欲望のままに、全てを決めるのは――俺だ」\n\n未練だらけで一度目のダンジョン人生の幕を閉じた男は第二の人生で己の異能を駆使し、どんな強者でも討ち倒す！"
  },
